@baseUrl = http://localhost:5285
@churchId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@personId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@typeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@groupId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@householdId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@memberId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@leaderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
# Copy the version (or ETag) from the latest GET of the resource you are changing.
@version = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@cookie = REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_IDENTITY_COOKIE

### Active same-church limited lookup; use an authenticated selected church. Lists are paged: pass nextOffset back as offset
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/people/lookup?name=Ada
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Scoped profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/people/{{personId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Staff create; contacts and household optional, account link not accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/people
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Ada","lastName":"Lovelace"}

### Scoped profile update; a missing If-Match returns 428, a stale one 412
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/church/people/{{personId}}
If-Match: "{{version}}"
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Ada","lastName":"Lovelace","email":null,"phone":null,"isActive":true}

### Staff list suggested duplicates (same name, email, or phone); the earlier record comes first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/people/duplicates
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}

### Staff mark a pair as different people so it is no longer suggested
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/people/duplicates/dismissals
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"personId":"{{personId}}","otherPersonId":"{{otherPersonId}}"}

### Staff merge a duplicate into this person; If-Match is the survivor's version. Fields default to "Merge"; cannot be undone
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/people/{{personId}}/merge
If-Match: "{{version}}"
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"duplicateId":"{{otherPersonId}}","duplicateVersion":"{{otherVersion}}","fields":{"email":"Duplicate","household":"Survivor"}}

### Group types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/group-types
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Single group type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/group-types/{{typeId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Staff create type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/group-types
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Community"}

### Staff rename type
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/church/group-types/{{typeId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Community group"}

### Accessible groups; Staff can read ended groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Single group
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Staff create group; type optional
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Tuesday community","startsAt":"2026-11-01T00:00:00Z","groupTypeId":null}

### Staff update group
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}
If-Match: "{{version}}"
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Tuesday community","startsAt":"2026-11-01T00:00:00Z","groupTypeId":"{{typeId}}"}

### Membership history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/members
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Single membership interval
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/members/{{memberId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Join; repeat to create another independent interval
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/members
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"personId":"{{personId}}","startsAt":"2026-11-02T00:00:00Z"}

### Leave without deleting history
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/members/{{memberId}}/end
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"endsAt":"2026-11-20T00:00:00Z"}

### Person leadership history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/leaders
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Single leadership interval
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/leaders/{{leaderId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Staff assign Person leadership; does not link an account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/leaders
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"personId":"{{personId}}","startsAt":"2026-11-02T00:00:00Z"}

### Staff end leadership without deleting history; the person leaves the group
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/leaders/{{leaderId}}/end
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"endsAt":"2026-11-20T00:00:00Z"}

### Staff promote a Member to Leader (or step a Leader down to Member); both intervals are kept
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/assignments/{{memberId}}/role
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"Leader","startsAt":"2026-11-10T00:00:00Z"}

### Associated household structure only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/households/{{householdId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Create optional household; omitted label defaults from the first member's LastName
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/households
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"memberIds":["{{personId}}"]}

### Replace whole household membership, without editing Person profiles
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/church/households/{{householdId}}
If-Match: "{{version}}"
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"label":"Lovelace household","memberIds":["{{personId}}"]}

### Staff end group; retains all history
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/groups/{{groupId}}/end
If-Match: "{{version}}"
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"endsAt":"2026-11-21T00:00:00Z"}

### Invalid required name returns 400; a missing/mismatched church header returns 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/church/people
Cookie: {{cookie}}
X-Sheaf-Church: {{churchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":" "}

### Unknown scoped resource returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/church/people/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Cookie: {{cookie}}
